(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF ELECTRONICS AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY \(MEITY\)) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRODUCTION LINKED INCENTIVE SCHEME \(PLI\) FOR LARGE SCALE ELECTRONICS \(PLI-ELECTRONICS\) / INDUSTRIAL FINANCE CORPORATION OF INDIA \(IFCI\) / MEITY) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Offers an incentive of 4% to 6% on incremental sales \(over base year\) of) Tj
T*
(goods manufactured in India to boost domestic electronic component) Tj
T*
(manufacturing and attract large investments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Target segments: Mobile phones and specified electronic components) Tj
T*
(   \(semiconductors, passive components, PCBs\).) Tj
T*
(2. Companies registered in India with committed cumulative investment and) Tj
T*
(   incremental sales thresholds.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 4% to 6% incentive on incremental sales of manufactured goods for a) Tj
T*
(   period of 5 years following the base year.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 6.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 500.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Certificate of Incorporation) Tj
T*
(2. Audited Financial Statements & Base Year Sales Audits) Tj
T*
(3. Investment and Capex Invoices Certified by Statutory Auditor) Tj
T*
(4. GST Returns & E-Way Bills) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MeitY Single Window Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.meity.gov.in/esdm/pli) Tj
T*
